olution, and sends the data back to your classical laptop.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"a63e89376e9f\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"image\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Vertical flowchart showing the Quantum-as-a-Service workflow: User submits algorithm via API, Cloud Platform manages the job, and Quantum Data Center returns results.\\\",\\\"asset\\\":{\\\"_ref\\\":\\\"image-3faf1caebe49b47361286a46e6a731aeb5cd3032-1024x1536-png\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"reference\\\"},\\\"caption\\\":\\\"Figure 1: The Quantum-as-a-Service (QaaS) model. You send the job to the cloud, and the results are sent back to you.\\\",\\\"display\\\":\\\"full\\\"}],\\\"closingContent\\\":null,\\\"faqs\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"6ab0fed82e5a\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"ccb3cae90b37\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"c8ba4e60c64f\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Abu Dhabi's Technology Innovation Institute (TII) is a regional leader in quantum research. In addition to developing its own qubits, TII has secured access to Quantinuum’s \\\\\\\"Helios\\\\\\\" system, providing UAE researchers with a 50-logical-qubit processor to advance fields like cryptography and material science.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is the UAE building its own quantum computer?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"d4d354cf6d00\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"5a4497179a07\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"386673748a5d\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"The Quantum Innovation Summit 2026 will be held from April 7–9, 2026, at the Grand Hyatt Dubai. Hosted by the UAE Cyber Security Council, the event brings together global experts to discuss the future of quantum technology and cyber resilience in the region.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"When is the Quantum Innovation Summit 2026 in Dubai?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"fbc30ec1bc4a\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"e4ff5e263b62\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"dc8129ebe74f\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"The UAE National Encryption Policy is a government mandate requiring critical sectors (finance, energy, government) to begin transitioning to Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC). Its goal is to protect sensitive national data from future decryption attacks by quantum computers.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"What is the UAE National Encryption Policy for 2026?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"46c0512aff25\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"9e6f5d98c1c7\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"14452e4d58f8\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"UAE businesses can use the \\\\\\\"Quantum-as-a-Service\\\\\\\" (QaaS) model. Platforms like IBM Quantum and Amazon Braket allow companies to access quantum processors via the cloud using standard APIs, enabling them to run experiments and solve optimization problems without investing in physical hardware.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"How can UAE businesses use quantum computing without buying hardware?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"266172eb52ce\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"059686549c68\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"b80c2adf66e5\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"The primary beneficiaries in the UAE are the Energy sector (for carbon capture and battery optimization, as seen with ADNOC), Logistics (for port and shipping route optimization), and Finance (for high-speed risk modeling and fraud detection in the DIFC).\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"What industries in the UAE will benefit most from quantum computing?\\\"}],\\\"intro\\\":\\\"From the Quantum Innovation Summit in Dubai this April to TII's new \\\\\\\"Helios\\\\\\\" system, 2026 is the year quantum goes commercial. This executive guide covers the transition to logical qubits, the UAE's National Encryption Policy, and the strategic roadmap for local businesses.\\\",\\\"listItems\\\":[],\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Executives in a Dubai boardroom analyzing quantum computing data on a holographic screen.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/07f6b42b913816ab42df6ee63bfb78cbdaeeec1d-1920x1080.webp\\\"},\\\"publishedAt\\\":\\\"2025-12-28T12:04:00.000Z\\\",\\\"seoDescription\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"seoTitle\\\":\\\"Quantum Computing 2026: UAE Strategy, Use Cases \\u0026 Policy\\\",\\\"showAffiliateDisclosure\\\":false,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"quantum-computing-strategy-uae-2026\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Quantum Computing in 2026: The UAE Strategic Guide \\u0026 Future Trends\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-23T05:48:47Z\\\",\\\"relatedLists\\\":[],\\\"relatedProducts\\\":[]}}]]}],\\\"$L34\\\"]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"43\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"shortcut icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon.png\\\"}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"44\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon.png\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/png\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"192x192\\\"}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"45\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon-v2.svg\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/svg+xml\\\"}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"46\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/favicon.ico\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"any\\\"}]\\n30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"47\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"apple-touch-icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/apple-icon.png\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"180x180\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/png\\\"}]\\n31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"48\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"mask-icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon-v2.svg\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"#4b0082\\\"}]\\n32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"49\\\",{}]\\n\"])</