 top-ten\",\"children\":\"top-ten\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"text-gray-400 shrink-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"mthhwq\",{\"d\":\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center min-w-0\",\"aria-current\":\"page\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"truncate max-w-[150px] sm:max-w-[200px] md:max-w-md text-gray-900 font-semibold block\",\"title\":\"Quantum Computing in 2026: The UAE Strategic Guide & Future Trends\",\"children\":\"Quantum Computing in 2026: The UAE Strategic Guide & Future Trends\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 min-w-0 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6 md:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 mb-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Quantum Computing in 2026: The UAE Strategic Guide & Future Trends\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 gap-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Last Updated:\"}],[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2025-12-28T12:04:00.000Z\",\"children\":\"28 December 2025\"}]]}]}],false]}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"data\":{\"_type\":\"topTenList\",\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"9509f1cf820f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"551132be1edb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Introduction\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"dfd00f078ba2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d1fbef974105\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"As we approach 2026, quantum computing is undergoing a fundamental transition. It is moving beyond physics labs into an era of early commercialization. For UAE businesses, the conversation is shifting from \"},{\"_key\":\"a15c153c7477\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"\\\"how does it work?\\\"\"},{\"_key\":\"bb9c493e7cbb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to \"},{\"_key\":\"0e66325642e4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"\\\"how do we prepare?\\\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ca86a89d9ce5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"db7b16eb98db\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"While the timeline for a fully fault-tolerant quantum computer is still unfolding, the \\\"Quantum Era\\\" has effectively begun in the Emirates. From the approval of the \"},{\"_key\":\"958e9433cc12\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"National Encryption Policy\"},{\"_key\":\"3e9f2a027724\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to the arrival of world-class hardware at \"},{\"_key\":\"aa123acf2e83\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"TII\"},{\"_key\":\"7596e34d5c71\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", the infrastructure is being built today. This guide outlines the critical milestones for 2026 and the strategic steps UAE leaders must take now.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0a0d160ecc6e\",\"_type\":\"relatedLink\",\"label\":\"Foundational Guide\",\"preText\":\"Need a refresher on qubits, superposition, and how the technology actually works? Check out our deep dive:\",\"targetPost\":{\"_ref\":\"8eba1116-de0d-4bb7-9c92-254cc670719e\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},{\"_key\":\"4be070fcd938\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cccf85bb0569\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"1. Policy Alert: The \\\"Q-Day\\\" Preparation\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"1b8df679c72f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"da01ec791602\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE is not just watching this revolution; it is hosting it. 2026 is set to be a landmark year for local quantum advancement.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7f6fe6d05eaf\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"db4ba9844df8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Summit:\"},{\"_key\":\"10f5550e97fe\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Mark your calendar for \"},{\"_key\":\"a5a39438ed10\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"April 7–9, 2026\"},{\"_key\":\"02f5866455d6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". The \"},{\"_key\":\"358d90ebe7d3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Quantum Innovation Summit\"},{\"_key\":\"19a5fec7829c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" returns to the Grand Hyatt Dubai, hosted by the UAE Cyber Security Council. The theme, \"},{\"_key\":\"a61279efd376\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"\\\"Quantum Frontiers,\\\"\"},{\"_key\":\"8c12e15db12d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" will bring together global experts to define the region's roadmap.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"12dbaf26ea71\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"544af7a68e7a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"TII & \\\"Helios\\\" (The Hardware):\"},{\"_key\":\"c29770245d31\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Abu Dhabi's Technology Innovation Institute (TII) has secured access to Quantinuum’s \"},{\"_key\":\"ecc21888c387\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"\\\"Helios\\\" system\"},{\"_key\":\"c9df3dbf0db9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\". Unlike older machines, Helios offers \"},{\"_key\":\"bece788ecab0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"50 logical qubits\"},{\"_key\":\"5caf3ec5f66f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (created from 98 physical qubits). This is a massive leap in fidelity, giving UAE researchers access to one of the most accurate quantum computers in the world.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f54764f07306\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"736d9f383c82\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Education:\"},{\"_key\":\"a699c285b9aa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Local talent is rising. Institutions like \"},{\"_key\":\"22bc88b9d215\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Khalifa University\"},{\"_key\":\"411ddc3f1079\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" and \"},{\"_key\":\"4909e79c9ef5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"MBZUAI\"},{\"_key\":\"9852bd455d52\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" are now actively offering minors and research tracks in Quantum Computing, feeding the local workforce pipeline.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"11b346670e58\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"10767b769a33\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"2. Policy Alert: The \\\"Q-Day\\\" Preparation\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"5156069da4b3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a37137d439db\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The most urgent update for CIOs and CISOs is the UAE's \"},{\"_key\":\"7d7e2256b38c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"National Encryption Policy\"},{\"_key\":\"1703939fe1c3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", approved in late 2025.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d0d7063a8ca6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"22a917398d8c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Mandate:\"},{\"_key\":\"9842e8747b0c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The policy explicitly calls for government entities and critical sectors to develop transition plans to \"},{\"_key\":\"4d3490623bd1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC)\"},{\"_key\":\"54a090205d5a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"088358597c2e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1c79455fa20a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Why Now? (Harvest Now, Decrypt Later):\"},{\"_key\":\"1039a616faf4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Even though quantum computers cannot break encryption \"},{\"_key\":\"8f354e4d3e21\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"today\"},{\"_key\":\"884910c9f892\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", hackers are stealing encrypted data \"},{\"_key\":\"db4784f09171\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"now\"},{\"_key\":\"73aee12988ab\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to decrypt it later when the technology matures.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a505b361b10c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"15ef892429f9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Action:\"},{\"_key\":\"1bbee0b26c61\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The policy requires an immediate \\\"Cryptographic Inventory\\\"—an automated audit of every key and certificate in your organization to identify vulnerabilities.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ae73e5fd26ea\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0a6decd4d7a0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"3. Real-World Applications: Where Value is Emerging\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"d6322e88f2cf\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9bffe6e44c3c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Quantum computing is finding its first commercial footholds in problems that are naturally complex.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b25a0c3f7c70\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"84467814a881\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Energy (ADNOC Partnership):\"},{\"_key\":\"5bd4984579c6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" In a landmark project, TII and ASPIRE are collaborating with \"},{\"_key\":\"003b7f4dd04d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"ADNOC\"},{\"_key\":\"1af5657a2400\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to use quantum sensing technology. They are applying it to monitor \"},{\"_key\":\"c93320fdc9a1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Carbon Capture and Storage (CCS)\"},{\"_key\":\"0ebcbc078256\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" sites with unprecedented precision and to model battery chemistry for sustainable energy solutions.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"093bf4fcd9cc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"44a19846a706\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Logistics:\"},{\"_key\":\"f20972a68012\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" With Dubai being a global port hub, quantum annealing is being explored to optimize complex shipping routes and container distribution in real-time.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"04faa0277bc3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cc73dcba40a6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Finance:\"},{\"_key\":\"41c08cde7f81\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Banks in the DIFC are testing quantum algorithms for high-speed portfolio optimization and fraud detection, analyzing vast datasets faster than classical supercomputers.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4d33a4f47dc5\",\"_type\":\"relatedLink\",\"label\":\"2026 Tech Update\",\"preText\":\"Google just overhauled your inbox. See what's new:\",\"targetPost\":{\"_ref\":\"07e140ef-ae3b-4896-a4da-4ed9067031c3\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},{\"_key\":\"0c697ddc869b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"61d75d123f7c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"4. The 2026 Global Trend: \\\"Hybrid\\\" is the New Standard\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"80e5fb653383\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"58b1cef73b33\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The industry has moved past the idea that quantum computers will replace your laptop. The standard for 2026 is \"},{\"_key\":\"ad769cf3571a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Hybrid Workflows\"},{\"_key\":\"9ca0a590f6c7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\":\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e630e757c455\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"31759eb9c23d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Classical Computers\"},{\"_key\":\"2d6ec62acf83\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" handle the logic, data processing, and user interface.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ccedcb30d6ba\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2ef32dbce5c6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Quantum Processors (QPUs)\"},{\"_key\":\"409ef4b1bc4b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" act as specialized accelerators—similar to how GPUs power AI—handling the heavy optimization or simulation tasks.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ce55109edf7f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"175fb5a56ce8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"5. Strategic Roadmap for UAE Leaders\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"047898dd1217\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"81098eea3d2c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If you are a decision-maker in the UAE, here is your 3-step checklist for 2026:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"3ba68d84c364\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cafb0702a153\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Educate & Attend\"},{\"_key\":\"ad8bf5c9b733\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Send your technical leadership to the \"},{\"_key\":\"4be7e5000b5c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Quantum Innovation Summit\"},{\"_key\":\"9225da68f423\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" in April. Understanding the ecosystem is the first step to identifying opportunities.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4c1ce126a7e3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b646f610c7f8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Secure Your Data (Immediate Priority)\"},{\"_key\":\"bee971005da3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Audit your data today. If you hold sensitive records (medical, national infrastructure, or banking) that must remain secret for 10+ years, you are already at risk. Start your migration to \"},{\"_key\":\"71d22e53c461\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC)\"},{\"_key\":\"d5d34a0d241f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" immediately to comply with the new National Policy.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6eea1547ac94\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9bb4044a331c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Experiment via the Cloud (QaaS)\"},{\"_key\":\"6978fadc74da\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The most common question business leaders have is: \"},{\"_key\":\"8d31a2350bae\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\",\"strong\"],\"text\":\"\\\"How do I actually use a quantum computer? Do I need to buy one?\\\"\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"number\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a75e95afeb40\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a98c763696ae\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The answer is No.\"},{\"_key\":\"fae4837a46cb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" You use it via the cloud (API), just like you use ChatGPT or AWS today. You send a problem to the quantum processor, it calculates the solution, and sends the data back to your classical laptop.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a63e89376e9f\",\"_type\":\"image\",\"alt\":\"Vertical flowchart showing the Quantum-as-a-Service workflow: User submits algorithm via API, Cloud Platform manages the job, and Quantum Data Center returns results.\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-3faf1caebe49b47361286a46e6a731aeb5cd3032-1024x1536-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Figure 1: The Quantum-as-a-Service (QaaS) model. You send the job to the cloud, and the results are sent back to you.\",\"display\":\"full\"}],\"closingContent\":null,\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"6ab0fed82e5a\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"ccb3cae90b37\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c8ba4e60c64f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes. Abu Dhabi's Technology Innovation Institute (TII) is a regional leader in quantum research. In addition to developing its own qubits, TII has secured access to Quantinuum’s \\\"Helios\\\" system, providing UAE researchers with a 50-logical-qubit processor to advance fields like cryptography and material science.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Is the UAE building its own quantum computer?\"},{\"_key\":\"d4d354cf6d00\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"5a4497179a07\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"386673748a5d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Quantum Innovation Summit 2026 will be held from April 7–9, 2026, at the Grand Hyatt Dubai. Hosted by the UAE Cyber Security Council, the event brings together global experts to discuss the future of quantum technology and cyber resilience in the region.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"When is the Quantum Innovation Summit 2026 in Dubai?\"},{\"_key\":\"fbc30ec1bc4a\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"e4ff5e263b62\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"dc8129ebe74f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE National Encryption Policy is a government mandate requiring critical sectors (finance, energy, government) to begin transitioning to Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC). Its goal is to protect sensitive national data from future decryption attacks by quantum computers.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the UAE National Encryption Policy for 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"46c0512aff25\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"9e6f5d98c1c7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"14452e4d58f8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"UAE businesses can use the \\\"Quantum-as-a-Service\\\" (QaaS) model. Platforms like IBM Quantum and Amazon Braket allow companies to access quantum processors via the cloud using standard APIs, enabling them to run experiments and solve optimization problems without investing in physical hardware.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How can UAE businesses use quantum computing without buying hardware?\"},{\"_key\":\"266172eb52ce\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"059686549c68\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b80c2adf66e5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The primary beneficiaries in the UAE are the Energy sector (for carbon capture and battery optimization, as seen with ADNOC), Logistics (for port and shipping route optimization), and Finance (for high-speed risk modeling and fraud detection in the DIFC).\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What industries in the UAE will benefit most from quantum computing?\"}],\"intro\":\"From the Quantum Innovation Summit in Dubai this April to TII's new \\\"Helios\\\" system, 2026 is the year quantum goes commercial. This executive guide covers the transition to logical qubits, the UAE's National Encryption Policy, and the strategic roadmap for local businesses.\",\"listItems\":[],\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Executives in a Dubai boardroom analyzing quantum computing data on a holographic screen.\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/07f6b42b913816ab42df6ee63bfb78cbdaeeec1d-1920x1080.webp\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-28T12:04:00.000Z\",\"seoDescription\":\"\",\"seoTitle\":\"Quantum Computing 2026: UAE Strategy, Use Cases & Policy\",\"showAffiliateDisclosure\":false,\"slug\":\"quantum-computing-strategy-uae-2026\",\"title\":\"Quantum Computing in 2026: The UAE Strategic Guide & Future Trends\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-23T05:48:47Z\",\"relatedLists\":[],\"relatedProducts\":[]}}]]}],\"$L34\"]}]]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"link\",\"43\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"link\",\"44\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"192x192\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"link\",\"45\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon-v2.svg\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"link\",\"46\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"sizes\":\"any\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"link\",\"47\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-icon.png\",\"sizes\":\"180x180\",\"type\":\"image/png\"}]\n31:[\"$\",\"link\",\"48\",{\"rel\":\"mask-icon\",\"href\":\"/icon-v2.svg\",\"color\":\"#4b0082\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"$L35\",\"49\",{}]\n34:[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full lg:w-80 shrink-0 space-y-8 mt-12 lg:mt-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 